text = "So after a lot of Investigation it turns out the slides were in our mind. They were nothing but a piece of delusion in our minds.

Our existential crisis made us imagine hypothetical scenarios where our supposed hardworking, deterministic selves had the time of the day and the night and the day to make these amazing slides. 

We now realise we are DUMB."
